@startuml
!include style.iuml
' UC-10 Supervise Exam Live (M10). Built from activity_monitoring_b and seq_uc10.
' Code: Admin_Web_Panel LiveMonitorPage (JoinExamGroup, tiles Stable / Warning / Suspicious / Critical / Disconnected,
' student drawer with timeline and captures); MonitoringHub SendWarning / ExtendStudentTime / UnlockSession /
' ForceSubmitSessionById (ExamAccessService check, audit); MonitoringController.Heartbeat ack carries warnings,
' remaining time, unlock time and session status to the desktop app.
' Plain labels: hub method names, audit events and limits are left out.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 25
}

|Invigilator (Web Panel)|
|Server|
|Desktop App|
|Invigilator (Web Panel)|
start
:Open Live Monitor,
pick an exam;
|Server|
if (Owner, assigned
invigilator or
admin?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes])
  :Send one tile
  per student;
endif
|Invigilator (Web Panel)|
repeat
  :Tile updates: heartbeats,
  violations, screenshots,
  disconnects (UC-05)<
  if (Open a
  student?) then ([yes])
    :View timeline,
    screenshots and
    webcam snapshots;
  else ([no])
  endif
  if (Act on the
  student?) then ([yes])
    :Warn, add time,
    unlock, relock, record
    an incident or
    force-submit;
    |Server|
    :Check access,
    save it, log it;
    |Desktop App|
    :Next heartbeat
    reply: show the
    warning, update
    time, unlock or
    end the exam;
    |Invigilator (Web Panel)|
  else ([no])
  endif
repeat while (Exam\nrunning?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
stop
@enduml
